error[8-0117]: a runtime choice between accesses needs a projection
  ┌─ access_choice.fe:6:13
  │
6 │     let x = if c { mut s.a } else { mut s.b }
  │             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this chooses between accesses at runtime
